'''Evil Cat Awakes!''' (開眼の吾輩は、鬼である襲来 ''Kaigan no Wagahai Wa, Onidearu Shūrai!'', '''Awakened, I Am a Demon Attacks!''') introduces the [[True Form]] of [[Evil Cat (Rare Cat)|Evil Cat]] - Gentleman Bros. This event was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]].

